Package: mlogitfast
Title: Fast Exact Multinomial Probit Behind the mlogit Interface
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Peter", "Cotton", email = "peter.cotton@microprediction.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Deterministic maximum likelihood for the multinomial probit
    choice model, replacing GHK simulation with an exact factor-conditional
    product integral. Accepts 'mlogit'-style 'dfidx' data and formulas for
    alternative-specific covariates. The covariance is parameterized as
    rank-2 factors with zero reference loadings and unit idiosyncratic
    variance, which covers the same identified model space as 'mlogit's
    differenced-Cholesky parameterization with the same degrees of freedom.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Imports: stats
Suggests: mlogit, dfidx, testthat
Encoding: UTF-8
